# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# type:    feat | fix | refactor | chore | style | docs | test | perf | build | ci | revert
# scope:   optional, lowercase, e.g. (auth), (report), (migrations)
# subject: imperative, lowercase, <= 72 chars, no trailing period
#
# Examples:
#   feat(auth): add password reset flow
#   fix(report): correct class average calculation
#   refactor(routes): extract admin actions into modules
#   chore: bump pdm.lock dependencies
#
# Body (optional, blank line after subject):
#   Explain the *why*, not the *what*. Reference issue numbers when relevant.
